Optional services (not included, only called over HTTP)
-------------------------------------------------------
SearXNG (https://github.com/searxng/searxng, AGPL-3.0) can be run separately and queried through its JSON API for the
search checks. No SearXNG code is part of this project. The files in searxng/ are only configuration for running it.
Gemini is called through the Google Agent Development Kit with your own API key.
